  "safetyDeleteConfirm": "Send a request to delete your anonymous identity and associated online data. The developer will review it within 30 days. Other players’ local copies are separate; safety evidence may be retained for a limited period. This request does not delete local files.",
  "safetyIdentity": "Show my data identifier",
